<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore Reinsurance 1H net profit up.</title>
<headline>Singapore Reinsurance 1H net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore $ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    5.18   vs   4.70</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	9.26   vs   8.44</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	    5.00   vs   5.00</p>
<p>    Turnover		     37.98   vs  38.08</p>
<p>    Investment income	   4.33   vs   4.73</p>
<p>    Underwriting profit	 3.05   vs   2.13</p>
<p>    Pretax			  7.40   vs   6.71</p>
<p>    Tax			     2.22   vs   2.01</p>
<p>Div pay/register : Oct 4 1996, Sept 20 1996</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Singapore Reinsurance Corp Ltd.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080 ds sd</p>
</text>
